            <ArticleTitle>Perioperative care of the patient with hemophilia undergoing urgent appendectomy.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>894-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report the presentation of acute appendicitis in a 20-year-old man with hemophilia A. We review the pathophysiology of hemophilia A and the current recommendations regarding factor VIII replacement in the perioperative period to ensure adequate hemostasis.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
